{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_handoff_chat13_to_chat14", "label": "HANDOFF (chat 13 \u2192 chat 14), 2026-08-25 \u2014 BUILD-14", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pre-restart lineage, numbered 15 on disk while describing chat 13 \u2192 14; its self-identification line exists because the previous handoff's three did not agree with the files."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_the_reading_gate", "label": "THE READING GATE \u2014 G1\u2026G4, with a printed certificate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The fatal fault of every session since chat 11 was work begun before the record was read; a practice clause registered twice did not hold, so it is a gate now. Stated failure mode: any count recited from a prompt rather than READ from a file means the gate has not passed."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_guard_py_does_not_exist", "label": "guard.py DOES NOT EXIST", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The standing directive names an instrument that was never shipped; it was built after chat 11 and deleted with the chats that had fatal flaws. A directive naming a tool is not evidence the tool exists \u2014 and reconstructing it is M's call, not an assumption."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_never_shipped_instruments", "label": "Never shipped, never to be asked for (press_all.py, bundle.py, mkref.py, figs.py, pageproof.py, ratios.py, regsize.py)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_ruling_27_two_registers", "label": "RULING 27 \u2014 TWO REGISTERS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The register compendium is only for subject matter; all reader-perspective audits and editorial entries are strictly for the working register and forbidden from the books as irrelevant to any reader."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_ruling_27_amendment", "label": "R27 AMENDMENT \u2014 verifying the books' own printed numbers is editorial", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verifying a result against the world is subject matter and kept; verifying the truth of a number the books state is editorial and excised."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_ruling_28_papers_absorbed", "label": "RULING 28 \u2014 the L\u00f6wdin and three-body papers are absorbed, not rebuilt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L\u00f6wdin = Chapter 35 (1701\u20131712), three-body = Chapter 36 (1713\u20131724); the deliverable set is six volumes, not eight."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_register_headings_vs_numbers_held", "label": "1,447 headings against 1,472 numbers \u2014 HELD, not a new finding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both figures are true of different objects; R1478 recorded it and M held it at PR1 because no computation consumes it. Report it if it moves; do not re-ask."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_task_2_citations_go_with_the_entries", "label": "TASK 2 \u2014 28 entries, 66 sites: under Ruling 27 the citations go with the entries", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grouped headings must be expanded when parsing entry numbers: a naive ^### (\\d+) parse produced a phantom class of 16 entries that vanishes once grouping is honoured."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_w_001_twenty_two_audits", "label": "W-001 \u2014 Chapter 3's residue of the three removed register-audits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five surviving sites reduced twenty-five to twenty-two, including an orphan predicate left by the earlier removal."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_handoff_chat13_to_chat14", "target": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_the_reading_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_handoff_chat13_to_chat14", "target": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_guard_py_does_not_exist", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_handoff_chat13_to_chat14", "target": "recovered_handoff_15__99520fa7_never_shipped_instruments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-15__99520fa7.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source